OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween warning to black cat
OL,4,Aowners from charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity is issuing advice to
OL,7,Fblack cat owners ahead of Halloween and
OL,8,FBonfire Night.
OL,10,FCats Protection recommends keeping your
OL,11,Fpet inside at night, to not dress them
OL,12,Fup and make sure your cat is
OL,13,Fmicrochipped.
OL,15,FThe charity says black or black and
OL,16,Fwhite cats can be the target of abuse
OL,17,Fand cruelty at this time of year.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
