OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween warning to black cat
OL,4,Aowners from charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Kerry McGeachy, operations manager
OL,7,Fof the Ferndown centre, said: "It is
OL,8,Fimportant to remember that cats are
OL,9,Fprotected under the Animal Welfare Act,
OL,10,Fso if you see people acting
OL,11,Fsuspiciously around cats, then we would
OL,12,Fadvise you to call the police."
